'''Sakura''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Sakura Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Sakura Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
The knife takes the shape of a tanto katana but with a Valentines Day theme. Its blade is white with a long, wavy pink spine. The guard is made out of three blooming Sakura blossoms, hence the name. The handle is white with pink laces wrapped around it, connected by golden pearls. Attached to the bottom of the handle by a golden prong is the pink pommel. 

== Trivia ==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Blossom]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sakura Set|Sakura Set]].
** It also partners with it’s own effect, [[Petals]].
*This and its partner gun are the fourth gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]]. The gamepass was eventually replaced by the [[Rainbow Bundle]].
*It is the second Valentine’s Day themed [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife, the first being [[Heartblade]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

